# switch-frames (H3): frames of the x-to-x2 switch on the paused clock.
# shot switch-f0 shows the render-phase curves (old whole, new at draw 0);
# the frames lines shoot at +83, +450 and +1000 ms after the click.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
click 174.5 187
shot switch-f0
frames switch-f83 every 83 for 83
frames switch-f450 every 367 for 367
frames switch-f1000 every 550 for 550
